  "sourceTitle": "A benchmark for LLMs playing Civilization V. GLM-5.3 is ahead of Opus-5.5, and Qwen-3.8-27B holds up surprisingly well.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "96d5e615c1b8a8cca46e000ba4d7181d950533e40eeff5c1fd294ddf945b0bda",
